                "title": "Egg and Dart Plate with Georgetown Knob, Brass Accents D05-K568-GEO",
                "description": "Brass Accents D05-K568-GEO, Egg and Dart Plate with Georgetown Knob - The Egg and Dart Plate with Georgetown Knob features a clear crystal egg-shaped knob. Together with the Egg and Dart Backplate, this latchset will be a perfect addition to any traditional home. It will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
